        " قَالَ رَسُولُ اَللَّهِ صَلَّى اَللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَ آلِهِ : «إِيَّاكُمْ وَ اَلتَّعْرِيسَ عَلَى ظَهْرِ اَلطَّرِيقِ وَ بُطُونِ اَلْأَوْدِيَةِ فَإِنَّهَا مَدَارِجُ اَلسِّبَاعِ وَ مَأْوَى اَلْحَيَّاتِ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.2499 - Al-Sakuni narrated with his chain of transmission that the Messenger of Allah (swt) (peace and blessings of Allah (swt) be upon him and his family) said:\n\"Beware of resting along the middle of roads and in the valleys, for they are pathways for wild beasts and shelters for snakes.\""
        ]
      }
